<title>USA: Consumer prices move up 0.3 percent in February.</title>
<headline>Consumer prices move up 0.3 percent in February.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices moved up moderately in February, the Labor Department said Wednesday, new evidence supporting the view that inflation remains mostly under control.</p>
<p>The department said the Consumer Price Index rose 0.3 percent after expanding 0.1 percent in January.</p>
